   5:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   * @brief   CMSIS Cortex-M4 Device Peripheral Access Layer System Source File.
   6:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
   7:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *   This file provides two functions and one global variable to be called from 
   8:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *   user application:
   9:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemInit(): This function is called at startup just after reset and 
  10:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                      before branch to main program. This call is made inside
  11:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                      the "startup_stm32f4xx.s" file.
  12:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  13:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClock variable: Contains the core clock (HCLK), it can be used
  14:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                  by the user application to setup the SysTick 
  15:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                  timer or configure other parameters.
  16:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                     
  17:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClockUpdate(): Updates the variable SystemCoreClock and must
  18:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                 be called whenever the core clock is changed
  19:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                 during program execution.
  20:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  21:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  22:frameworks/f407/Core/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   ******************************************************************************
